    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Painted Legend 2</strong> is an atmospheric platformer crafted in a unique grid notebook style. It continues the story begun in <strong>Painted Legend</strong>, as the player once again steps into a hand-drawn world filled with adventure, danger, and mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the north, an ancient evil has awakened - a mysterious necromancer spreads fear and destruction. The wizard Partas and his nephew, the warrior Favian, embark on a distant journey to stop the looming threat. Along the way, new playable characters will be introduced, each with their own abilities and combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a world where every line and stroke is part of a living narrative. You\u2019ll experience thoughtful platforming, exploration, combat, and a distinctive visual atmosphere where imagination comes to life on grid-lined pages.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Painted Legend 2</strong> is an atmospheric platformer crafted in a unique grid notebook style. It continues the story begun in <strong>Painted Legend</strong>, as the player once again steps into a hand-drawn world filled with adventure, danger, and mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the north, an ancient evil has awakened - a mysterious necromancer spreads fear and destruction. The wizard Partas and his nephew, the warrior Favian, embark on a distant journey to stop the looming threat. Along the way, new playable characters will be introduced, each with their own abilities and combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a world where every line and stroke is part of a living narrative. You\u2019ll experience thoughtful platforming, exploration, combat, and a distinctive visual atmosphere where imagination comes to life on grid-lined pages.</p>",
